{"id":2351,"name":"parseXML","kind":64,"kindString":"Function","flags":{},"children":[],"sources":[{"fileName":"packages/node-utils/src/data/index.ts","fullFileName":"/home/runner/work/fe-tools/fe-tools/utils/packages/node-utils/src/data/index.ts","line":195,"character":16,"url":"https://github.com/MichealWayne/fe-tools/blob/9c1268f/utils/packages/node-utils/src/data/index.ts#L195"}],"signatures":[{"id":2352,"name":"parseXML","kind":4096,"kindString":"Call signature","flags":{},"comment":{"summary":[],"blockTags":[{"tag":"@function","content":[{"kind":"text","text":"parseXML"}]},{"tag":"@description","content":[{"kind":"text","text":"解析基础 XML 元素、属性、重复子节点和实体引用。Parses basic XML elements, attributes, repeated children, and entity references."}]},{"tag":"@returns","content":[{"kind":"text","text":"以根元素名为键的对象；属性放在"},{"kind":"code","text":"`@attributes`"},{"kind":"text","text":"，混合文本放在"},{"kind":"code","text":"`#text`"},{"kind":"text","text":"和有序的"},{"kind":"code","text":"`#content`"},{"kind":"text","text":"。Object keyed by the root element name; attributes use "},{"kind":"code","text":"`@attributes`"},{"kind":"text","text":", and mixed text uses "},{"kind":"code","text":"`#text`"},{"kind":"text","text":" plus ordered "},{"kind":"code","text":"`#content`"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}]},{"tag":"@remarks","content":[{"kind":"text","text":"支持普通元素、属性、注释、处理指令、CDATA 和预定义/数字实体；不解析 DTD 或自定义实体。Repeated child elements are returned as arrays. DTDs and custom entities are not resolved."}]},{"tag":"@example","content":[{"kind":"code","text":"```ts\nconst xml = '<root><item>value</item></root>';\nconst data = parseXML(xml);\n```"}]}]},"parameters":[{"id":2353,"name":"xmlString","kind":32768,"kindString":"Parameter","flags":{},"comment":{"summary":[{"kind":"text","text":"XML字符串。XML string"}]},"type":{"type":"intrinsic","name":"string"},"text":{"comment":"<p>XML字符串。XML string</p>\n"}}],"type":{"type":"intrinsic","name":"any"},"is":{"declaration":false},"location":{"query":"node-utils/src.Function.parseXML","hash":"parseXML"},"text":{"comment":"<h5>Function:</h5><p>parseXML</p>\n<h5>Description:</h5><p>解析基础 XML 元素、属性、重复子节点和实体引用。Parses basic XML elements, attributes, repeated children, and entity references.</p>\n<h5>Returns:</h5><p>以根元素名为键的对象；属性放在<code>@attributes</code>，混合文本放在<code>#text</code>和有序的<code>#content</code>。Object keyed by the root element name; attributes use <code>@attributes</code>, and mixed text uses <code>#text</code> plus ordered <code>#content</code>.</p>\n<h5>Remarks:</h5><p>支持普通元素、属性、注释、处理指令、CDATA 和预定义/数字实体；不解析 DTD 或自定义实体。Repeated child elements are returned as arrays. DTDs and custom entities are not resolved.</p>\n<h5>Example:</h5><pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">xml</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&#x3C;root>&#x3C;item>value&#x3C;/item>&#x3C;/root><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>;\n<span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">data</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">parseXML</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">xml</span>);\n</code></pre>\n"},"sources":[{"fileName":"packages/node-utils/src/data/index.ts","fullFileName":"/home/runner/work/fe-tools/fe-tools/utils/packages/node-utils/src/data/index.ts","line":195,"character":0,"url":"https://github.com/MichealWayne/fe-tools/blob/9c1268f/utils/packages/node-utils/src/data/index.ts#L195"}],"parentId":2351}],"is":{"declaration":true},"location":{"query":"node-utils/src.Function.parseXML","hash":""},"text":{},"parentId":965}
